Error [E1297]: `serve` is already a job in ./main.jet
 Why: the project job `serve` wins in this directory, so the global tool would be shadowed here (JPK-TOOL-COLLIDE).
 Fix: install under a different bin name  ->  jetpack tool install serve@nixpkgs --as <other>
     or just run it once                  ->  jetpack use serve@nixpkgs -- <command>
